---
description: Rust engineering rules for maintainable services, libraries, CLIs, and performance-sensitive modules.
globs:
  - "**/*.rs"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Clarify project shape, async runtime, and crate layout first.
- Keep handlers thin and business orchestration outside transport layer.
- Model errors explicitly and document non-obvious ownership, concurrency, or unsafe constraints.

## Cross-Project Standards

新项目启动、设计系统制定或跨页面规范统一时，先读取 `project-standards-playbook/SKILL.md` 及其适用细则；小修复按影响范围应用，保留已有确认参数。
